  "body": "Indulge in luxurious living in this stunning property located on 680sqm of prime real estate, perfectly positioned and elevated high on the hill. The spacious home is infused with an abundance of sun and natural light, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere that oozes elegance. \r\n\r\nNestled in one of Bucklands Beach's most desirable streets, this property boasts breath-taking views across the Estuary and up to the city skyline and Rangitoto. Take in the magnificent vistas from the expansive decking and revel in beautiful sunsets and spectacular nightlights in the comfort of your own home. \r\n\r\nThe ground level of this residence features three generous bedrooms, one luxurious bathroom, a fully equipped kitchen, and its own living area, spacious storage, and own laundry and two letter boxes. This area is ideal for independent living adult children, grandparents, or extended family.\r\n\r\nOn the first level, you will find a triple internal garage, a separate lounge, a luxurious master bedroom complete with a walk-in wardrobe, a separate laundry, powder room, and a gorgeous kitchen with a scullery. This level is perfect for entertaining guests as the open plan living/dining areas flow seamlessly onto the decking for summer evenings. With three outdoor entertaining options and three separate indoor living areas, this home offers ample space for everyone to unwind and relax. \r\n\r\nLocated in the quality school zoning of Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Macleans College, this property offers an excellent education for your family. Don't miss out on the chance to experience the everyday masterpiece you've been dreaming of. \r\n\r\nLive in a quality home surrounded by natural beauty. Contact us today to arrange a viewing.",
